Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within your\Ndreams Taking aim for your heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,so it would seem Stand tall and read,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,go to hell and jump for\Nparadise Every time dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,dangerous We like it serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,serious, oh Looking deep in the dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.10,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,there is the one in pain Turns out that's\Nthe one who means the most to you today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go The balls filled between us, they\Nwill show Still what we don't know Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.74,0:01:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,working hard together Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.30,0:01:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers Got to dream\Ndespite the rivalry Gotta see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,it through believing in you\NThere's even charm in failure Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.46,0:01:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears\Nin the world we're in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up our thought\Nagain, yeah We're the foolish ones we love,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll carry on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.70,0:01:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we see the light, the sun will rise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core is\Nagainst myself forevermore Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,let's do it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go The bonds built between us,\Nthey will show So what we don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what we call adventure Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers Got to dream\Ndespite the rivalry Gotta see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,it through believing in you\NThere's even charm in failure Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers Superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers\NSuperpowers Superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.98,0:02:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,32 minutes remaining\Nbefore Luffy's planned
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,rendezvous with his crew on Kaku Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.82,0:02:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No Straw Hat and no Katakuri either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.42,0:02:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess their fight is really dragging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.92,0:02:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Straw Hat's tougher\Nthan we thought he was?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you trying to imply here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.12,0:02:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat might win?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that's not happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:03:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And you get that through\Nyour thick skull, Nuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.22,0:03:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you picking on me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Nushi and I didn't say anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri doesn't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.42,0:03:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his whole thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get with the program, you dope! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike you, Nuuji,\NKatakori's the perfect man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not Nuuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Nuuji, Nuu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.91,0:03:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You owe us one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not how it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, something has to be going\Non in there that bothers me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Put yourself in Straw\NHat's shoes for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not supposed to rendezvous\Nwith his crewmates until 1am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, even if he\Nwasn't expecting an ambush,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.76,0:03:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no point in coming early.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.74,0:03:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't win the fight,\Nbut he can capture Barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.78,0:03:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's the key to\Nthe mirror world, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So he grabs her,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,jumps through a mirror, and waits it\Nout on some island where it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:03:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That explains why nobody's heard\Nfrom her in such a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.44,0:04:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is likely running for his life\Nright now, but that doesn't change much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Because once 1 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,hits, he'll be coming out of\Nthis mirror one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So our plan still works.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Brulé's not too quick on the upticks,\Nbut it's no surprise she'd get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Akimek, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.98,0:04:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If she's listening through a mirror\Nsomewhere, you might make her cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Still half an hour, but\Nlet's try to stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't mind if you\Ncome early, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My sickle can't wait to meet your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They're armed, meaning they're\Npirates, not civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:05:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have broken all the other mirrors,\Nso Luffy has to come out of that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The second he shows, we're\Ngoing to have to haul ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we're both dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be in a hurry, so we might\Nneed to say our goodbyes soon, Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you all the way over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I happen to like it over here, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.34,0:05:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And for the record, I can\Nhear you perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fudgy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking back, it was pretty\Nfunny how we met, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.52,0:05:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your fiancé, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Charlotte Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.06,0:05:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I want us to get married tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.24,0:05:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we weren't together for\Nlong, but I had a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you say that when I lied to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you smile at me like that, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to apologize while I still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I keep doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we're still enemies\Nat the end of the day, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,From your perspective, our marriage\Nwas just a means to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap staged from the start to the finish
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,with me walking straight\Ntowards my own death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it must have\Nbeen an awful experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But there was nothing bad about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you were by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, hey, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I didn't insult you or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.32,0:07:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you stupid dears!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean anything\Nbad by it, okay? Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.20,0:07:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One last thing, before you\Ngo, stay right there, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:08:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive efforts from the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Just can't keep them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If they still managed to escape\Ndespite your preparations,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,that would indeed be frightfully big news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.62,0:09:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I bet you'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But those fools haven't got a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.08,0:09:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to swallow our pride,\Nbut we're ready this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We dispatched a whole army to make sure\Nthey never pull one over on us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So even if Gold Roger himself\Npops out of that mirror somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you better believe we'll\Nshut him down fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we're done with the Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.32,0:10:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,will line their severed heads in a row\Nand you can put that on your front page?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,sends a message, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's rather tasteless\Nnot to mention unnecessary
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's just the\Nright amount of brutality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a whole fleet out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.30,0:10:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way their ship\Nis making it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.42,0:10:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Work over that cake right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The tail's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.60,0:10:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the road, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be long dead before\Nwe make it to that island.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.82,0:11:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's trash the cake\Nand make a break for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to lose your cool on me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Lili?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We all came from different\Nplaces, but we're together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So whether we live or die, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a stinking family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I see something
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.22,0:11:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Fluffy Island
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.90,0:11:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give it one final push I\Nwant to see some hustle, boys
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we'll make it by 1am\Nlike we promised at least i know
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,luffy can win a fight but i'm\Na bit worried about him getting
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,out if he can't capture Barrel\Nand use her power again then he'll
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,be stuck in the mirror world\Nluffy is not the kind of person to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.62,0:12:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,carefully calculate that sort of\Nthing is he unfortunately no then
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.96,0:12:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to help him out what\Nshould we do come to think of it i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,don't know if we'll be able to\Ntell what time it is really well
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a lot that could go wrong\Nbut we still believe in you Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.58,0:12:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when he falls, he\Ndoesn't land on his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're headed to Kaku Island right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.46,0:13:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's going to be at least\N10 hours before we make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So around 1 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,First things first, kick that guy's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then look for a mirror\Nthat leads to Kaku Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.58,0:13:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll meet you there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What time is it anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me one last thing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you return to defeat Big Mom someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.00,0:14:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm gonna be king\Nof the pirates Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're seeing quite far into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.46,0:14:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.18,0:15:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Branch, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.58,0:15:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.88,0:15:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap, I can't get\Nout of here without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time left!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.06,0:15:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he do this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Barrel, you rotten little imp!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.76,0:15:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of dirty trick you\Nused to beat my brother, but shame on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:16:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So you brought down Katakuri, huh,\Nkid? Most impressive! Eat out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.88,0:16:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.06,0:16:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mysterious mistoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I've captured Barrel for you and have\Nbeen waiting here to aid in your escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you made it out, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Peckle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.92,0:16:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro sacrificed his life to save you\Nand your crew so you can't die now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.70,0:16:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.22,0:16:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost 1 a .m., and I'm sure\Nyour friends are waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.86,0:16:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I want no part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.24,0:16:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cacao Island, straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.64,0:16:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A massive fleet indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, how are\Nthings looking over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's not here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get close to the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to bring Luffy to the\Nship without engaging the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The clock is ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.62,0:17:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are your weapons ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If Straw Hat is going to show,\Nthen it'll be in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your funeral is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.70,0:17:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Only four minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.40,0:17:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Straw Hat ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:17:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they've spotted us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It truly is an overwhelming number.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't take us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.20,0:18:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Set them on the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.22,0:18:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We are gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupe, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintain our distance from the shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems wise to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoothie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.49,0:18:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's our next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need to rush into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll simply support the\Nmain force from the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The Totoland Grand Fleet, led by\NSnap, is immediately ahead of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.60,0:18:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,With us to their rear, they don't\Nhave an inch of wiggle room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.60,0:18:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're doomed even if they\Ndo make it to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.56,0:18:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oven has a massive army ready\Nand waiting to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:18:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever they do next is inconsequential.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.74,0:19:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the line for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep all the transponder snails connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.20,0:19:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We need intel from every angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.36,0:19:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to give them a crushing defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, sir, I'll keep you posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're saying your prayers, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.22,0:19:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making us wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, come on. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody. Anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.80,0:19:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Sulong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a primal form.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When a mink stares at a full moon, then\Nthey turn Sulong and wield incredible power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I'm not good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:19:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rather at controlling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:19:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The transforming part I can do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll become nothing\Nmore than a raging beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And then what? Mayhem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.54,0:20:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start running wild and\Ndestroy everything around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.26,0:20:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody can reach me once\NI'm like that. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.68,0:20:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Because there's only one man\Nwho could save me from myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.14,0:20:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's big bro Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.36,0:20:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Pec-Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.22,0:20:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.42,0:20:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There was just something about\Nhis voice that calmed me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.58,0:20:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He could always bring me back from the\Nedge before I completely lost myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I transform, there won't be\Nanyone left who can reach me in that state.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.62,0:20:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.12,0:21:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, there's a full\Nmoon tonight, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.48,0:21:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So when I go through this mirror\Nto Kaku Island, I'll transform.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And then all bets are off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.90,0:21:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm going on a\Nrampage in my Sulong form,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.08,0:21:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that'll be your chance to\Nescape from Kaku Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.54,0:21:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That plan'll never work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.02,0:21:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll butcher you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the force of Cacao Island is\Nbig enough to launch a whole war.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.80,0:21:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you transform, they'll cut you\Ndown like the traitorous fool you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't drop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannon, we're not listening to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.12,0:21:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat will be there in a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare forget\Nwhat Pedro did for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.76,0:21:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot let his\Nsacrifice be made! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.94,0:21:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Peckums.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.30,0:21:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.44,0:21:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.35,0:22:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's your turn brewing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.66,0:22:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.57,0:22:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming from inside the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.56,0:22:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.22,0:22:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That totally sounds like Barrel,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.74,0:22:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,as I thought she was captured\Nand used by Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.02,0:22:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He will pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.12,0:22:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming aim and fire! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.02,0:23:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Miss Hampec Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You had better start talking or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.22,0:23:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare move an inch—you try any\Nfunny business and you'll regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.52,0:23:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me—this gun ain't no joy, don't\Nyou think I will blow her brains out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.86,0:23:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.77,0:23:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please put
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the gun down—are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.92,0:23:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pecos, what are you trying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.42,0:23:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's calm down and talk this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.44,0:23:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.66,0:23:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her go—don't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.84,0:23:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,kill me have mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.90,0:23:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This disguise was pointless, since they'd\Nknow who I was as soon as I transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No turning back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.40,0:23:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I will protect Straw Hat with\Nevery last ounce of my strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.14,0:24:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,because he is the man that Big\NBrother Pedro put his life on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.20,0:24:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.42,0:24:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's too long for him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.32,0:24:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Pestle, don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.88,0:24:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna flip out and\Nget all of us killed, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.58,0:24:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.46,0:24:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.28,0:24:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.86,0:24:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.24,0:24:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.30,0:24:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.82,0:24:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.50,0:24:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected Straw Hat or at least\NKatakuri to come out of the
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.20,0:24:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,mirror and instead I get to deal\Nwith this deranged circus freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.68,0:24:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no right to\Npoint a gun at my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.62,0:24:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So put that damn thing down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.68,0:25:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.44,0:25:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.16,0:25:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Weeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.36,0:25:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.42,0:25:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That was cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.66,0:25:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.46,0:25:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.64,0:25:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.02,0:25:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Better, better, better, better, better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.12,0:25:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.38,0:25:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me? Yes, Angie! Good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.38,0:25:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.62,0:25:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.96,0:25:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Petcombs was hiding him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.74,0:25:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.94,0:26:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have tricked Katakuri\Nand made a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.96,0:26:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.32,0:26:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.32,0:26:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.68,0:26:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, why'd you jump?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.20,0:26:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an easy target, up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.74,0:26:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.76,0:26:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Raisin!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.50,0:26:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's helping out Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.86,0:26:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.50,0:26:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Win your fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.24,0:26:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.82,0:26:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, I knew he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.76,0:26:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trying to escape through the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.74,0:26:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Blackleg!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.08,0:26:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.06,0:26:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy to counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.90,0:26:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're special?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.24,0:26:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We could use Gippo too, dummy! One!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.14,0:26:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.42,0:26:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.48,0:26:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.20,0:27:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it so he'll never\Nsee the full moon again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.48,0:27:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Peckhams, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.06,0:27:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ignoring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.50,0:27:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.30,0:27:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Struggle as hard as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.46,0:27:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can overcome this many foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.06,0:28:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely even you must realize it by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.14,0:28:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.22,0:28:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an explosion at the harbor!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.68,0:28:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.52,0:28:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what just happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.54,0:28:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The ships near the shore are all burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.48,0:28:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.10,0:28:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a bombing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.28,0:28:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got an entire fleet\Nof snacks, sir! Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.40,0:28:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.16,0:28:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jerobo Double Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.08,0:28:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.50,0:28:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we wiped them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.26,0:28:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that report a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.54,0:28:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Next round!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.80,0:28:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.26,0:28:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Jerobo Double Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.42,0:28:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.64,0:29:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,German Devil Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.00,0:29:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You owe us after that tea party.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.10,0:29:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll pay with interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.74,0:29:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't test your luck with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.50,0:29:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you come to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.02,0:29:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sanji, you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.50,0:29:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We stopped by to crush these fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.72,0:29:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't let you have all the fun.
